    { name: "Step 4 — Read your Medicare MAGI and IRMAA tier result", text: "Enter the amounts in the calculator. Your Medicare MAGI total is displayed alongside your 2026 IRMAA tier and estimated monthly Part B and Part D surcharge amounts." }
  ]}
